# e-Invoicing Custom API v1.3

## Disclaimer

**** Warning: at this point, ITAS API does not support asynchronous or multithreading calls for POST, PUT, PATCH and DELETE requests. Async or multithreading requests could result in various Error messages, or even a corruption of data in extreme cases and are therefore not supported. ****
<br />
<br />
<strong>Release notes</strong> (6<sup>th</sup> May 2026.)

## New Endpoints

<ul>
<li>None</li>
</ul>

## Updated Endpoints

<ul>
<li>Invoices <b>Incoming Invoice Record List</b>: Additional Array InvoiceVatRecords, remove property DocmanDocumentId, Additional Property on InvoiceRecordLeg - BaseQuantity,<a href="/#reference/invoices/incoming-invoice-record-list/list-incoming-invoice-records"> Link</a></li>
<li>Invoices <b>Incoming Invoice Record Create</b>: Additional Array InvoiceVatRecords, remove property DocmanDocumentId, Additional Property on InvoiceRecordLeg - BaseQuantity,<a href="/#reference/invoices/incoming-invoice-record-create/create-incoming-invoice-record"> Link</a></li>
<li>Invoices <b>Incoming Invoice Record Update</b>: Additional Array InvoiceVatRecords, remove property DocmanDocumentId, Additional Property on InvoiceRecordLeg - BaseQuantity,<a href="/#reference/invoices/incoming-invoice-record-update-delete/update-incoming-invoice-record"> Link</a></li>
</ul>
<div>** ends ** </div>


