# Group Data Object Definitions
List of re-usable Data Objects referenced as `object` types. Not that these endpoints are not accessable and only here for reference purposes.

## Invoice Record Leg [/InvoiceLeg]
A multipurpose object which can be used by several endpoints and with multiple source tables depending on context. The object described below is generic. 

### InvoiceRecordLeg [GET]
<br /><br />
<strong>Invoice Record Leg object for Create.</strong>

|Property|Description|Type|Max Length|Notes|Constraint|
|--------|-----------|----|----------|-----|----------|
|Quantity|Quantity|`number`|||Required|
|WeightCode|Weight Code|`string`|4||Required|
|Value|Value|`number`|||Required|
|Price|Price|`number`|||Required|
|VatRatePercentage|Vat Rate Percentage|`number`|||Required|
|InvoiceRecordLegDescription|Invoice Leg Description|`string`|255|||
|VatRateCode|Vat Rate Code|`string`|2|||
|RateTypeCode|Rate Type Code|`string`|1||`A`=Amount, `R`=Rate, `S`=SplitAmount, `W`=WeightRate, `%`=Percent, `Q`=DailyPercent, `C`=PerContainer, `L`=PerRailcar, ` `=None|
|PriceTypeCode|Price Type Code|`string`|1|||
|PaymentModeCode|Payment Mode Code|`string`|1|||
|PaymentId|Payment Id|`string`|255|||
|BuyerOrderIdentifier|Buyer Order Identifier|`string`|50|||
|StartPeriod|Start Period|`datetime`||||
|EndPeriod|End Period|`datetime`||||
|FreeFormatNote|Free Format Note|`string`|255|||
|BaseQuantity|Base Quantity|`number`||||
|ValueType|Value Type|`string`|||`Contract`, `Cost` or `Commission`|
|CostHeadingCode|Cost Heading Code|`string`|8|||
|DocumentReference|Document Reference|`string`|9|||
|InvoiceCurrencyCode|Invoice Currency Code|`string`|3|||
|PhysicalTradeId|Physical Trade Id|`string`|10|||


<br /><br />
<strong>Invoice Record Leg object for Update and Read.</strong>

|Property|Description|Type|Max Length|Notes|Constraint|
|--------|-----------|----|----------|-----|----------|
|InvoiceRecordId|Invoice Record Id|`number`|||Required|
